<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Mullerthal Trail Route 2 — Mullerthal Trail Route 2</name><desc>Mullerthal Trail Route 2 is a demanding forest walk in eastern Luxembourg. Stairs descend into sandstone gorges, paths wind between tall rock walls, and dark fissures invite short explorations. The Schéissendëmpel waterfall adds a quieter stop. Allow two walking days for the full loop; repeated climbs make progress slower than the distance suggests. Bring a torch for the narrow passages, or use their signed bypasses.

